OL,3,GNEWSABaby thriving after 3D-printed
OL,4,Amodel used to save her heart
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baby girl is "thriving" after a
OL,7,Flife-saving operation by surgeons who
OL,8,Fused a 3D-printed model of her heart to
OL,9,Fprepare.
OL,11,FThirteen-month-old Penny has a
OL,12,Fcongenital heart condition which
OL,13,Faffects about five in every 10,000
OL,14,Fbabies, called Tetralogy of Fallot.
OL,16,FShe underwent open-heart surgery at
OL,17,FBirmingham Children's Hospital, where
OL,18,Fher parents faced an agonising wait for
OL,19,Fnews until their daughter came round.
OL,21,F"All of a sudden she had a twinkle in
OL,22,Fher eye," said her father, Brad.
